Scenario 

A photographer was hired to cover a corporate event called Hive Cybersecurity Summit 2026. 
After the event, one private photo of a VIP guest was leaked online before the official release. 
The photographer claims: 
"I only took the pictures. I did not leak anything." 
Investigators recovered one image file from the event media group: 
VIP_Backstage.jpg 

Your job is to analyze the metadata of this single photo and determine what happened;  the 
camera used, the exact capture time, the original filename, the editing software used, whether 
GPS data existed, whether metadata was stripped, whether a file was exported, whether 
timestamps are inconsistent, whether a file came from social media, whether an image was 
copied to USB, and whether a person's story matches the technical evidence.
